[[File:Pyrefiend icon.png|left]]
'''Pyrefiends''' are [[demons]] made of fire and molten rock{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote= 	Pyrefiends are beings of fire and molten rock, they're quick and agile but weak to water spells. |loc=|notes=|name=}} that require level 30 [[Slayer]] to kill. As their attacks are magic based, it is recommended to wear armour with a high magic defence bonus, such as [[Dragonhide armour|dragonhide]]. Pyrefiends and [[Harpie bug swarms]] are the only monsters to drop [[steel boots]].

If the [[Slayer Rewards|Bigger and Badder]] slayer reward is unlocked, there is a chance for a [[flaming pyrelord]] to appear upon killing a pyrefiend on slayer task.

The pyrefiends on the [[Isle of Souls]] are close by a cage/harpoon fishing spot. The fires with the examine text 'Hot!' around their spawn can be used for cooking the fish. This is useful for restricted accounts, as well for extending trips if needed.

